### Core Service REST tests
### Requires: VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create Account A
# @name createAccountA
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "alice",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Create Account B
# @name createAccountB
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "bob",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Get Account A
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{createAccountA.response.body.$.id}}

### Transfer A -> B
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_account_id": 21,
  "to_account_id": 22,
  "amount": 50.000
}

### Negative test: invalid currency
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "charlie",
  "currency": "JPY"
}

### Negative test: invalid transfer amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_account_id": 1,
  "to_account_id": 2,
  "amount": 0
}
